#: 4600b4aa151441b08a5816b2448acaa9
msgid "Roll, pitch, throttle and yaw channel mappings can be changed using :ref:`RCMAP Input Channel Mapping <common-rcmap>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:138
#: f7f7eb3c4a4641f288a1f01d084538f9
msgid "Flight mode switch setup to specify which vehicle modes are enabled by each switch position can be found on the :ref:`RC Transmitter Flight Mode Configuration <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` page"
msgstr ""

